  "description": "Package which allows to add a custom Mediator to be used in REST Api controllers. This using a rule based system can centralise the standard REST Api responses, deciding what ActionResult to return. Minded helps to implement a clean architecture, offering the scaffolding necessary to implement patterns like Mediator, Decorator, Command and Query and more.\nEncapsulate all your business logic in Commands and Queries, the rest will be dealt by the framework.",
